- Identity is local password authentication, not ESIA/Gosuslugi authentication.
- Signing and disbursement are state transitions plus demonstration documents,
  not legally valid signatures, real accounts or payment operations.
- News feed is an editorial demonstration corpus, not a live verified news wire.
- Product catalogue follows the supplied project specification dated 2026-10-21.
  Public source URLs are preserved for traceability. Demonstration interest rates,
  fees and decision thresholds are not represented as actual bank offers.

